{
  "slug": "wordpress-devkit",
  "name": "Wordpress Devkit",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Scaffold WordPress themes and plugins, debug white screens and errors, audit PHP for common vulnerabilities, and generate Gutenberg blocks.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **6 skills**, **3 agents**, **3 commands** and **2 hooks**.\n\n- **Skills** (6): `db-migration` (Generate safe wp-cli search-replace commands for a WordPress URL migration), `gutenberg-block` (Generate a custom Gutenberg block), `plugin-scaffold` (Scaffold a WordPress plugin), `security-audit` (Audit a WordPress theme or plugin PHP for common vulnerabilities), `theme-init` (Scaffold a modern WordPress block theme), `wp-debug` (Diagnose a WordPress white screen, 500 error, or fatal error)\n- **Agents** (3): `block-author` (Use when the user asks to build, extend, or debug a Gutenberg block), `upgrade-planner` (Use when the user asks to plan a WordPress core or PHP upgrade, a batch of plugin upgrades,…), `wp-forensics` (Use when a WordPress site is white-screening, returning HTTP 500, showing \"There has been a critical error on…)\n- **Commands** (3): `doctor` (Check the local WordPress toolchain), `flush` (Clear WordPress caches in one pass), `hardening-check` (Run the full WordPress hardening and security pass in one command)\n- **Hooks** (2): `SessionStart`, `PostToolUse`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install wordpress-devkit@claude-community` from `mohitkale/wordpress-devkit`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
